<section id="about">
  <div class="section-inner">
    <div class="section-head">
      <span class="num">03</span>
      <h2>About</h2>
    </div>
    <p class="about-text">
      <strong>Unbuffed</strong> is a pop-up gallery series for emerging Australian artists —
      built to move. Starting in Brisbane, it sets up in a new city each stop: a warehouse,
      a spare room, a wall that isn't usually a gallery wall. No long leases, no polish for
      polish's sake. Just work shown as it actually is, in front of people who showed up.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="call" id="artists">
  <div class="section-inner">
    <div class="section-head">
      <span class="num" style="color:var(--pink)">04</span>
      <h2>Call For Artists</h2>
    </div>
    <p class="call-text">
      Unbuffed is looking for emerging artists for its first Brisbane show and future stops
      around the country. Applying is free — you only pay if your work is selected.
      Any medium, any stage.
    </p>
    <a class="btn btn-red" href="apply.html">Apply to exhibit →</a>
  </div>
</section>

